graph LR
    MLflow["MLflow Server<br/>odh-mlflow-rhel9 (3.17.0)"]

    %% Required plugin
    MLflow -->|kubernetes-auth + workspace store| Plugins["mlflow-kubernetes-plugins<br/>==2.1.1 (external)"]

    %% External libraries
    MLflow -->|ASGI| FastAPI["FastAPI / Starlette ==1.3.1<br/>uvicorn"]
    MLflow -->|legacy REST via WSGI| Flask["Flask, flask-cors, flask-wtf"]
    MLflow -->|metadata + migrations| SQLA["SQLAlchemy / Alembic<br/>psycopg2"]
    MLflow -->|artifact access| Boto["boto3 / botocore"]
    MLflow -->|tracing| OTel["OpenTelemetry"]
    MLflow -->|GraphQL| Graphene["graphene"]
    MLflow -->|Fernet, AES-GCM, PBKDF2| Crypto["cryptography"]
    MLflow -.->|optional /metrics| Prom["prometheus-flask-exporter"]
    MLflow -.->|disabled| Huey["huey job runner"]
    Plugins -->|K8s client| K8sLib["kubernetes Python client"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    Operator["MLflow Operator"] -->|deploys via Helm, MLflow CR| MLflow
    Gateway["ODH Data Science Gateway"] -->|HTTPRoute /mlflow| MLflow
    Dashboard["ODH Dashboard"] -->|module federation UI| MLflow
    Workloads["Workbenches / Pipelines /<br/>Training Jobs"] -->|MLflow SDK| MLflow

    %% External services
    MLflow -->|SSAR, namespaces, MLflowConfig| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    MLflow -->|5432/TCP| PG["PostgreSQL"]
    MLflow -->|443/TCP| S3["S3-compatible storage"]
    MLflow -.->|optional| AltStore["GCS / Azure Blob"]
    MLflow -.->|disabled| LLM["LLM providers"]
    MLflow -->|HMAC webhooks| WH["Webhook receivers"]

